      "rendered": "Annual Benefit Report 2022"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Annual Benefit Report Year 2022</strong></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>We are a purpose-driven organization that believes digital and technology companies can and should do more to create a positive impact in society.</em></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3225 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2.jpg\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 488px) 100vw, 488px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2.jpg 850w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2-300x180.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/b-corp-social-media-2-768x461.jpg 768w\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"293\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Get Lagos Now </strong>is a results driven, reliable team of experts that takes a 360 approach to your digital success locally and globally since 2010, while staying dedicated to helping make an effective impact on the elevation of local homelessness. 5%+ of all in-cash and in-kind donation of all business profits will continue to be donated to local non-profits yearly. <a href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/e-recycling/\">E-RecylingPDX.com</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3457\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural.jpeg 640w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Blanchet-House-Mural-300x225.jpeg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3446 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1024x488.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 761px) 100vw, 761px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1024x488.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-300x143.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-768x366.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block-1536x732.png 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/GLN_Values_Block.png 1544w\" alt=\"\" width=\"761\" height=\"363\" /></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-2710 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 230px) 100vw, 230px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo.png 597w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/Certified-B-Corp-Logo-300x232.png 300w\" alt=\"\" width=\"230\" height=\"177\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>B Corp Certified – We’re a new kind of business that balances purpose and profit. We make legal, financial, decisions, and actions required to consider the impact Get Lagos Now makes on the decisions of our workers, customers, suppliers, community, and the environment using our business as a force for good.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-2687 alignleft\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good.png\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 149px) 100vw, 149px\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good.png 800w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good-300x296.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/benefit-corps-good-768x757.png 768w\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"147\" /></p>\n<div id=\"wayp-4135\" class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element small-10 columns small-centered prk_9_em wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_verve_fade_waypoint verve_fade_waypoint wpb_start_animation\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"extra_pad prk_inner_block columns small-centered clearfix\">\n<div class=\"vrv_outer_row\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"vc_col-sm-9 columns vc_column_container wpb_column\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p class=\"vc_custom_heading\"> BCFG Certified – Our aim is to maintain a culture that aligns with the Benefit Corporation philosophy. <em>Benefit Corporations for Good</em> assessed our values and performance to ensure we’re operating within the standards of a Benefit Corporation. Our authenticity, accountability, messaging and diversity is high. Overall, we are in alignment with the principles and operate with the best interests of our employees, customers, communities and the environment.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-4197 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2023BCFG-1024x741.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"719\" height=\"520\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2023BCFG-1024x741.png 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2023BCFG-300x217.png 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2023BCFG-768x555.png 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2023BCFG-1536x1111.png 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2023BCFG-2048x1481.png 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 719px) 100vw, 719px\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"extra_pad prk_inner_block columns small-centered clearfix\">\n<h2><strong>In-Kind Donations</strong></h2>\n<h3>In 2022 the <strong>3rd Annual E-Recycling PDX Event</strong> was held on  August 12th at PCC Sylvania – This year the 4th Annual E-Recycling PDX event will be held at the non-profit Rose Haven, on August 26th from 10am &#8211; 4p.  More details can be found at both <strong><a href=\"http://E-RecyclingPDX.com\">E-RecyclingPDX.com</a></strong> and <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://getlagosnow.com/4th-annual-e-recycling-pdx-event-aug-26-2023/\"><strong>getlagosnow.com/4th-annual-e-recycling-pdx-event-aug-26-2023</strong></a></span></h3>\n</div>\n<h3>We’re happy to announce that <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #0000ff;\" href=\"https://rosehaven.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https://rosehaven.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1641970828269000&amp;usg=AOvVaw07V0jr-SSR4FenOtDXW13d\">Rose Haven</a></strong></span> received 5 refurbished laptops, 2 new desktops, many with new cords, and 3 I-phones with helped open two more check-in stations and cellphones for staff members.</h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://newavenues.org/\"><strong>New Avenues for Youth</strong></a> will be giving their electronic donations  to youth in current programs that are in need. This year they received a total of 2 laptops.</h3>\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://raphaelhouse.com/\">Raphael House </a></strong>received 3 newly refurbished laptops. All refurbishing is completed by <a href=\"https://strategicitpro.com/\">Strategic IT</a> – a Windows certified IT company in Portland, Oregon.</h3>\n<h3><a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"><strong>Blanchet House </strong></span></a>received 7 newly refurbished laptops to use for both staff and working residents seeking and obtaining employment.</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color\">Cash Donation &amp; Equipment Donations</span></strong></h2>\n<h3> 28% of total company profits were donated to local non-profits in both cash and new technology donations.</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h2><strong><span class=\"has-inline-color\">Volunteerism</span></strong></h2>\n<h3><strong>Volunteer Hours – </strong>The <strong>Get Lagos Now Team</strong> had a total of 73 hrs. in volunteerism recorded supporting Portland, Oregon non-profits. Currently the Founder &amp; Managing CEO, Michelle Lagos, also serves on the <strong><a href=\"https://blanchethouse.org/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">Blanchet House</span></a> </strong>&#8211; Board of Directors.</h3>\n<h3><strong>Volunteer Driving Miles – </strong>The Get Lagos Now Team drove a total of 152 miles in volunteer miles in 2022.</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3907 aligncenter\" src=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"567\" height=\"378\" srcset=\"https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-300x200.jpg 300w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-768x512.jpg 768w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://getlagosnow.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/red-hands.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 567px) 100vw, 567px\" /></p>\n<div id=\"verve-760\" class=\"wpb_row vc_inner vc_row verve_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div></div>\n</div>\n",
